      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE DRAGON NZ (4) turned in an out-of-character effort last time out when 13 metres away in eighth over 1609m at Port Pirie. Form prior to that had been solid. The recent run not a true indication. Good enough to take out a race like this. LINXX (10) put the writing on the wall two runs ago then improved further last time out when he scored by 10 metres over 1800m at this track. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. This is a nice drop in grade so he is sure to prove tough to beat again. KITTYKAT CUTIE (9) is in the mix following a respectable second at her first run back over 1800m at this track. AMIRA MARIE (7) must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently when fourth at this track over 1800m.",
